<view class="page"><image class="brand-logo" src="/assets/dengfeng_logo.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="hero"><view class="hero-title">欢迎来到登峰</view><view class="hero-sub">先完善本人信息，后续预约无需重复填写</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{selfOpenid}}"><view class="title">工作人员关联码</view><view class="hint">如您是教练，请复制此码交给管理员关联账号。关联完成后点“刷新状态”。学员无需使用此码。</view><view class="muted" selectable="true">{{selfOpenid}}</view><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="copyOpenid">复制关联码</button></view><view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view class="title">绑定申请待核对</view><view class="hint">管理员核对后，您将可查看原档案与课时。请稍后重新进入。</view><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">刷新状态</button></view><view wx:elif="{{disabled}}" class="card"><view class="title">账号已停用</view><view class="hint">当前账号暂不能使用小程序，请联系中心管理员核对。</view><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">刷新状态</button></view><view wx:else class="card"><view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{mode==='new'?'tab-on':''}}" bindtap="modeNew">新学员建档</view><view class="tab {{mode==='bind'?'tab-on':''}}" bindtap="modeBind">已有档案申请绑定</view></view><view class="hint" wx:if="{{mode==='new'}}">首次来中心？创建本人档案，初始课时为 0。</view><view class="hint" wx:else>机构已为您建档？提交信息后由管理员核对，不会新建重复档案。</view><text class="label">姓名</text><input class="field" value="{{name}}" bindinput="inputName" maxlength="30" placeholder="请输入姓名"/><text class="label">手机号</text><input class="field" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="inputPhone" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入手机号"/><button class="btn" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="submit">{{mode==='new'?'创建档案':'提交绑定申请'}}</button></view></view>

